#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.rst:2
msgid "Filters"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres de filtrage communs aux localisations et aux trajectoires."
msgstr "Groups the filtering settings shared by localizations and tracks."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:5
msgid "``Save`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : enregistre séparément les résultats filtrés ; valeur par défaut : ``False``."
msgstr "``Save`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): saves filtered results separately; default value: ``False``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:7
msgid "``Plane`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckRangeInt.CheckRangeInt`) : intervalle des plans conservés ; valeur par défaut : ``[1, 100000]``."
msgstr "``Plane`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckRangeInt.CheckRangeInt`): range of retained planes; default value: ``[1, 100000]``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:9
msgid "``ROI`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckInt.CheckInt`) : indice de la zone d'intérêt utilisée pour le filtrage spatial."
msgstr "``ROI`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckInt.CheckInt`): index of the region of interest used for spatial filtering."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:10
msgid "``Localization`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.FiltersL.FiltersL`) : filtres propres aux localisations."
msgstr "``Localization`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.FiltersL.FiltersL`): localization-specific filters."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:11
msgid "``Tracks`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.FiltersT.FiltersT`) : filtres propres aux trajectoires."
msgstr "``Tracks`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.FiltersT.FiltersT`): track-specific filters."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:13
msgid "À faire"
msgstr "To do"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Filters.Filters:13
msgid "Vérifier les ordres de grandeur et les valeurs par défaut des filtres, notamment la plage de l'intensité intégrée des localisations."
msgstr "Check the orders of magnitude and default filter values, particularly the range of the localizations' integrated intensity."

